  "text": "ING. IN N.Z.\nMelhmirne\n9th. June, 1955.\nDear Mr. Mcfadyen,\nI was very pleased to see from this morning's\npapers that your name appeared\nin the Queen's Birthday\nHonours\nList\nthe recipient of a C.B.E.\nI would like to extend to you my sincere\ncongratulations on your Honour.\nKind regards,\nYours sincerely,\nC.H. MeFadyen, Esq.,\nsecretary\nepartment of Shipping & Iransport,\n497,\nCollins Street,\nMelbourne,\nC.1.\nROSE AND / VISiTER\nLORMA AND HALAY\nRT THEIR HOME\nI SURBiTON, SURREY\nWALLY IS NOW AT\nhi 310/65\nTR HALTER CRAME, WiFELORAR, AMANRA RUD JULiAN.\nON MONIARY AT NORFOLK BRORIS ENGLANA.\nHALLY HAS IN AUSTRALIA FOR SOMETIME AS A MUFFIEL SCHOLAR.\nTHE CRANE FAMILY LiVED ALONGSiDE US AT STLEOMARIS COURT SOUTN TARRA.",
